<section class="page-intro wrap"><p class="eyebrow">THE IMPORTANT DETAILS</p><h1>Your privacy.</h1><p class="page-lead">A clear explanation of what this website collects and why.</p></section><section class="wrap legal-layout"><aside><span class="eyebrow">WEBSITE PRIVACY NOTICE</span><a class="text-link" href="/reach-out">Ask a privacy question <?= icon('arrow-up-right') ?></a></aside><div class="prose"><h2>What you share with us</h2><p>When you request a store, we collect your name, business name, email address, business category, location, preferred plan, and any optional phone number. The contact form collects your name, email, selected topic, and message. The dispatch form collects your email and subscription consent.</p><h2>Why we collect it</h2><p>We use this information to understand your request, discuss store setup or delivery options, respond to enquiries, and manage dispatch subscriptions. A store or contact enquiry does not automatically subscribe you to marketing.</p><h2>How submissions are handled</h2><p>Requests are saved in private server storage outside the public website directory. They are not published on the site. The website does not collect payment card details or process payments through these forms.</p><h2>Cookies and abuse prevention</h2><p>We use an essential session cookie to secure forms and remember your confirmation reference. We also store a hashed client identifier and submission time to limit repeated requests. No advertising or analytics cookies are intentionally added to this site.</p><h2>Photography, fonts, and links</h2><p>Site photography, fonts, icons, styles, and scripts are served locally. Links to third-party services such as WhatsApp or Instagram appear only when configured. Those services handle visits under their own policies.</p><h2>Keeping information useful</h2><p>We keep enquiry information while it is needed to deal with your request or continue the business conversation. Contact us to request access, a correction, deletion, or an end to marketing contact. Use the contact form and select "Something else"; include your request reference if you have it. Do not send passwords or payment details.</p><h2>Changes to this notice</h2><p>This notice covers the marketing website. Any seller application, checkout, or additional service will need its own applicable details before you use it.</p><a class="text-link" href="/reach-out?topic=Something%20else">Contact us about privacy <?= icon('arrow-up-right') ?></a></div></section>
